# Uncompressed source recording — the committed asset is the 720p public/demo.mp4.
# Matched by the space in the filename, since git on Windows ignores case
# (a "Demo*.mp4" pattern would also swallow demo.mp4 itself).
/public/*[ ]*.mp4
